Description: A derivative of 'cancereffectsizeR' (Cannataro, Mandell, Townsend; GPL-3).
  This fork adds age-dependent selection estimation (linear, logistic, generalized sigmoid)
  and continuous-age modeling utilities used in the melanoma-age manuscript.
  Core methodology is by the original authors; this fork provides project-specific extensions.
  See the upstream project for the canonical package.
URL: https://townsend-lab-yale.github.io/cancereffectsizeR, https://github.com/Townsend-Lab-Yale/cancereffectsizeR, https://github.com/Townsend-Lab-Yale/melanoma-age/tree/main/cancereffectsizeR-age
